&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">here are 4 reasons you can't afford to waste time</a><!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p> </li><li class="yf-1jsc1up">      <p class="text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Robert Kiyosaki <a href="https://moneywise.com/news/economy/kiyosaki-us-baby-boomers-federal-reserve?throw=WTRN3_yahoo&amp;placement_syn=placement_3&amp;utm_source=syn_oath_mon&amp;utm_medium=BL&amp;utm_campaign=185419&amp;utm_content=syn_9a909625-0379-4c36-a35c-db59bfc5c68b" data-ylk="slk:issues%20grim%20warning%20for%20baby%20boomers;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;source:content-canvas%20default" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;issues grim warning for baby boomers&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">issues grim warning for baby boomers</a>: many could be 'wiped out' and homeless 'all over' the country<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p> </li><li class="yf-1jsc1up">      <p class="text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Vanguard's outlook on U.S. stocks is raising alarm bells for retirees. <a href="https://moneywise.com/retirement/retirement/vanguard-raise-alarm-stocks-retirees?throw=WTRN4_yahoo&amp;placement_syn=placement_3&amp;utm_source=syn_oath_mon&amp;utm_medium=BL&amp;utm_campaign=185419&amp;utm_content=syn_12472c1b-8cbb-4dde-b5e6-3a10dfc097a1" data-ylk="slk:Here's%20why%20and%20how%20to%20protect%20yourself;e